{{!
    @template local_dimensions/plan_actions

    The plan overview's actions row, between the hero and the filter line: the plan's status in its
    draft states, core's review action for this viewer, and the link to core's plan page. One quiet
    row, no heading. The review buttons need JavaScript, as on core's page, so they are drawn hidden
    and local_dimensions/plan_actions shows them once it has armed them; without it the row is the
    status and the link.

    Context variables required:
    * planid (int) - The plan id, sent to core's review services
    * hasstatus (bool) - Whether the plan is in a draft state (draft, waiting for review, in review)
    * status (object) - label (core's status name, plain text) and tone (neutral, warning, info)
    * isrequestreviewallowed (bool) - core's plan_exporter flag of the same name
    * iscancelreviewrequestallowed (bool) - core's plan_exporter flag of the same name
    * planurl (string) - core's plan page, with noredirect=1
    * planlinklabel (string) - "Manage plan" or "Plan page in Moodle", plain text

    @copyright  2026 Anderson Blaine
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Example context (json):
    {
        "planid": 10,
        "hasstatus": true,
        "status": {"label": "Draft", "tone": "neutral"},
        "isrequestreviewallowed": true,
        "iscancelreviewrequestallowed": false,
        "planurl": "https://example.com/admin/tool/lp/plan.php?id=10&noredirect=1",
        "planlinklabel": "Plan page in Moodle"
    }
}}
<div class="local-dimensions-plan-actions" data-region="local-dimensions-plan-actions" data-planid="{{planid}}">
    {{#hasstatus}}
    {{#status}}
    <span class="local-dimensions-status local-dimensions-status--{{tone}}" data-region="local-dimensions-plan-status">{{label}}</span>
    {{/status}}
    {{/hasstatus}}
    {{#isrequestreviewallowed}}
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" data-action="local-dimensions-plan-request-review" hidden>{{#str}}requestreview, tool_lp{{/str}}</button>
    {{/isrequestreviewallowed}}
    {{#iscancelreviewrequestallowed}}
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" data-action="local-dimensions-plan-cancel-review-request" hidden>{{#str}}cancelreviewrequest, tool_lp{{/str}}</button>
    {{/iscancelreviewrequestallowed}}
    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="{{planurl}}">{{planlinklabel}}</a>
</div>
